graph TB
    User((User)) -->|Uploads images| UI[Streamlit UI]
    UI -->|Sends raw image bytes| Preprocess[Image Preprocessing\n(normalisation, resizing)]
    Preprocess -->|Tensor + original PIL| Model[DR Classification Model\n(mambaout_small, fine‑tuned)]
    Model -->|Logits / probabilities| Inference
    Model -->|Activations & gradients| GradCAM[Grad‑CAM Engine]
    GradCAM -->|Heatmap| Overlay[Heatmap Overlay Generator]
    Preprocess -->|Original image| Overlay
    Overlay -->|Annotated image| UI
    Inference -->|Class label, probabilities| UI
    UI -->|Displays predictions + heatmaps| User